WEBVTT

00:00:16.708 --> 00:00:18.708
<i>Living in this world is hard.</i>

00:00:19.708 --> 00:00:23.833
<i>If you don't follow the set rules,</i>
<i>you're treated as an outcast.</i>

00:00:23.833 --> 00:00:24.875
HALF-DEMON GIRL – TOWA HIGURASHI

00:00:24.875 --> 00:00:28.958
HALF-DEMON GIRL – TOWA HIGURASH<i>I
I was so tired of it when I was in the other worl</i>d.

00:00:29.708 --> 00:00:31.250
KIRINMARU'S OLDER SISTER – ZERO
I won't forgive you!

00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:36.917
<i>What Zero is feeling now</i>
<i>is probably like how I felt back then.</i>

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.917
I will never forgive you!

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.792
SESSHOMARU
Tenseiga.

00:00:44.792 --> 00:00:47.792
I had lost my sense of self.

00:00:47.792 --> 00:00:53.625
I had always thought to leave disposing
of your daughters to Kirinmaru.

00:00:54.375 --> 00:01:00.792
But I can't take it anymore.
I will deal with your little brats myself!

00:01:01.208 --> 00:01:05.750
I will no longer falter.
This is who I am after all.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:08.417
PIRATE WASHED ASHORE – RIKU
Riku, bring me the Rainbow Pearls,

00:01:08.417 --> 00:01:10.875
the source of my demon powers.

00:01:10.875 --> 00:01:12.750
But Madam, please wait!

00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:25.042
Kirinmaru?

00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:31.000
I was wondering when he'd show up.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:33.000
SETSUNA &amp; MOROHA
No wonder Grandpa Myoga

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.375
bolted when he could.

00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:38.292
BEAST KING RULING
THE FOUR PERILS – KIRINMARU

00:01:56.125 --> 00:01:57.625
CAT DEMON – KIRARA

00:01:58.125 --> 00:01:59.208
Kirara!

00:02:01.708 --> 00:02:03.250
Thank you, Kirara.

00:02:03.542 --> 00:02:05.833
There's so much bloodlust in the air.

00:02:05.833 --> 00:02:08.875
Not to mention that
ridiculous demon energy.

00:02:09.458 --> 00:02:12.875
He looks so defenseless, and yet...

00:02:13.292 --> 00:02:15.125
I can't see an opening at all.

00:02:15.125 --> 00:02:18.125
He doesn't even need to
pay us any attention.

00:02:18.708 --> 00:02:21.625
If I even think about moving,
I'll get cut in two.

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:24.125
That much, even I know.

00:04:06.458 --> 00:04:09.125
"Sesshomaru's Daughter"

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:17.167
Kirinmaru, don't stop me.

00:04:19.333 --> 00:04:20.333
Sesshomaru.

00:04:21.375 --> 00:04:25.083
Allow me to be the one to
apologize about your Tenseiga.

00:04:26.292 --> 00:04:28.625
I feel remorse. Will you forgive me?

00:04:28.792 --> 00:04:30.083
Stop it, Kirinmaru!

00:04:30.083 --> 00:04:31.625
You have gone too far, Sister!

00:04:32.333 --> 00:04:33.458
Lord Kirinmaru.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:39.917
Your apology isn't necessary.
I had no attachment to Tenseiga.

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:48.708
As long as I have this Bakusaiga,
it will be enough.

00:04:48.875 --> 00:04:52.000
Interesting.
Will you cut me, Sesshomaru?

00:04:52.542 --> 00:04:55.000
Or should I say, <i>can </i>you cut me?

00:04:55.917 --> 00:04:58.000
It does not matter. I will cut you.

00:04:58.708 --> 00:05:02.375
Tenseiga cannot bring the same person
back from the dead twice.

00:05:02.875 --> 00:05:05.000
If you bring death upon me again,

00:05:05.792 --> 00:05:07.833
that woman whose life is still

00:05:07.833 --> 00:05:10.083
TOWA AND SETSUNA'S MOTHER – RIN
tied to mine will also die.

00:05:10.083 --> 00:05:12.292
TOWA AND SETSUNA'S MOTHER – RIN
Is that not your wish?

00:05:14.583 --> 00:05:17.000
Rin, are you crying?

00:05:17.375 --> 00:05:20.292
SESSHOMARU'S VASSAL – JAKEN
What's making you so sad?

00:05:20.292 --> 00:05:21.542
Any more of this...

00:05:22.208 --> 00:05:23.917
will only make Rin sorrowful.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.333
Sesshomaru.

00:05:34.042 --> 00:05:36.333
You didn't chase after Akuru's pinwheel.

00:05:36.917 --> 00:05:40.583
Out of respect for that,
won't you sheathe your sword?

00:05:40.667 --> 00:05:41.792
I refuse.

00:05:43.625 --> 00:05:44.917
Sister.

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:47.542
Sesshomaru is serious.

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:51.875
That human girl
will no longer act as your shield.

00:05:51.875 --> 00:05:54.167
Exactly what I have wished for.

00:05:54.417 --> 00:05:56.750
Step aside, Kirinmaru.

00:06:00.042 --> 00:06:03.500
Zero will just be more pitiful.

00:06:03.958 --> 00:06:06.333
I know. However...

00:06:06.333 --> 00:06:08.208
Stop getting in the way, Kirinmaru.

00:06:08.625 --> 00:06:13.167
If anything, this is an older sister's efforts
to protect your life.

00:06:13.333 --> 00:06:15.958
Are you repaying my charity
with ingratitude?

00:06:16.208 --> 00:06:17.958
How pathetic!

00:06:20.042 --> 00:06:24.792
That vain wish on some worthless orb
is what brought you this dishonor!

00:06:34.042 --> 00:06:35.708
Be gone!

00:06:41.708 --> 00:06:43.083
The Rainbow Pearls...

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:46.208
Oh, damn... There they go.

00:06:46.708 --> 00:06:49.917
I guess you two
still wanted to keep them.

00:06:53.708 --> 00:06:54.958
Really, now.

00:06:55.958 --> 00:06:58.458
Shall we sever our ties, Kirinmaru?

00:06:59.917 --> 00:07:01.292
Fine by me.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:09.792
From this moment forward,
we are nothing but strangers.

00:07:10.125 --> 00:07:12.708
You are no longer my brother,
nor I your sister.

00:07:13.292 --> 00:07:16.042
However, I hope you haven't forgotten.

00:07:16.042 --> 00:07:18.458
The Rainbow Pearls are my tears.

00:07:18.792 --> 00:07:22.958
No matter where they scatter,
I will always be able to find them.

00:07:24.875 --> 00:07:27.917
Farewell.
We shall never see each other again.

00:07:27.917 --> 00:07:28.875
Wait.

00:07:29.042 --> 00:07:30.167
Sister!

00:07:33.417 --> 00:07:35.750
I won't make any excuses.

00:07:36.417 --> 00:07:38.750
Are you betraying me?

00:07:39.042 --> 00:07:42.500
Otherwise, Madam won't have
a fighting chance.

00:07:43.125 --> 00:07:44.708
Farewell, Lord Kirinmaru.

00:07:48.042 --> 00:07:49.875
Why did he...

00:07:50.333 --> 00:07:52.000
<i>Huh? I wonder why...</i>

00:07:52.667 --> 00:07:56.000
<i>I was only able to talk to </i>
<i>Riku for a little bit...</i>

00:07:56.667 --> 00:07:58.750
<i>And I feel sad because of that.</i>

00:08:01.667 --> 00:08:03.750
Are you going after her, Sesshomaru?

00:08:04.083 --> 00:08:07.292
Leave the matter with Zero to me.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:09.667
Wait, Sesshomaru.

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:13.792
What of these girls?

00:08:14.542 --> 00:08:16.667
It's a rite of courage and cowardice.

00:08:22.917 --> 00:08:27.917
If you are Sesshomaru's daughters,
then your true worth comes from survival.

00:08:29.583 --> 00:08:32.083
It's inevitable if you're a half-demon.

00:08:36.125 --> 00:08:37.875
As you can see...

00:08:39.417 --> 00:08:43.292
I'm in quite the irritable mood today.

00:08:54.083 --> 00:08:58.125
If you had withdrawn,
I would have let you escape.

00:09:00.625 --> 00:09:05.667
But if you are to face me, I cannot
hold back as I did the last time.

00:09:05.917 --> 00:09:07.208
Are you all right with that?

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:10.875
You mean you held back last time?
You're kidding me.

00:09:11.125 --> 00:09:13.167
He's obviously lying!

00:09:13.583 --> 00:09:17.542
If this is a rite of courage and cowardice,
then I cannot simply withdraw.

00:09:20.167 --> 00:09:24.750
Then go ahead and unleash your powers,
and see how far you can get.

00:09:25.042 --> 00:09:26.000
Let's do this.

00:09:30.042 --> 00:09:32.583
I'm going to get Setsuna's dreams back!

00:09:43.958 --> 00:09:45.833
Cyclone Burst!

00:09:47.917 --> 00:09:49.583
You better dodge, Towa.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.625
Scourge of Swallows!

00:09:57.792 --> 00:09:59.917
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:10:05.167 --> 00:10:09.042
Crimson Backlash Wave!

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:19.375
Blasting Barrage!

00:10:23.792 --> 00:10:24.958
Cyclone Burst!

00:10:28.083 --> 00:10:29.042
What are you doing?

00:10:29.583 --> 00:10:31.625
It's better than getting hit by that.

00:10:37.958 --> 00:10:40.042
Your problem is your lack of spirit.

00:10:40.667 --> 00:10:42.542
If you hadn't depended on the Pearls,

00:10:43.083 --> 00:10:46.042
your inherent powers
would've manifested properly.

00:10:47.333 --> 00:10:49.583
Quit running your mouth!

00:10:49.583 --> 00:10:52.958
Focusing spirit powers...
Heavenly Arrow Barrage!

00:10:54.625 --> 00:10:56.625
Behold this force!

00:10:56.833 --> 00:11:00.333
When you're using spirit powers,
a Rainbow Pearl only gets in your way.

00:11:05.333 --> 00:11:06.583
Moroha!

00:11:12.667 --> 00:11:14.208
Well, then...

00:11:14.917 --> 00:11:17.667
I suppose I should respond in kind.

00:11:18.125 --> 00:11:21.667
I challenge you, girls!

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:26.333
DEMON SWORDSMITH – TOTOSAI
Hey, you there, Totosai.

00:11:27.667 --> 00:11:29.875
THREE-EYED COW DEMON – MOMO
Oh, it's you, Jaken.

00:11:29.875 --> 00:11:32.000
THREE-EYED COW DEMON – MOMO
Rin was crying.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:35.625
Can you hurry to the battle ground
where her daughters are fighting?

00:11:36.208 --> 00:11:38.417
We're going to the same place.

00:11:38.417 --> 00:11:42.000
But I don't think
we're gonna make it in time.

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:42.917
What?

00:11:42.917 --> 00:11:48.417
I'm talking about the birth of the
heavenly sword, Yukari no Tachikiri.

00:11:51.417 --> 00:11:53.167
Such power.

00:11:53.583 --> 00:11:55.167
This is strange.

00:11:55.458 --> 00:11:59.792
Where is the girl who managed
to land a cut on my cheek?

00:12:01.375 --> 00:12:02.500
Towa!

00:12:03.583 --> 00:12:07.708
Though your form is excellent,
your blade edge is subpar.

00:12:09.083 --> 00:12:13.625
With a blade edge like that,
you won't be able to scratch me.

00:12:17.833 --> 00:12:19.042
Setsuna!

00:12:19.958 --> 00:12:22.167
Oh, that's right.

00:12:23.042 --> 00:12:25.667
For you to manifest your true strength...

00:12:26.042 --> 00:12:30.917
your little sister must be in danger,
or so Riku witnessed.

00:12:33.125 --> 00:12:36.792
What a caring older sister you are.

00:12:46.333 --> 00:12:48.375
I suppose I let my guard down a little.

00:12:48.375 --> 00:12:50.542
Don’t lay a hand on Setsuna.

00:12:51.083 --> 00:12:55.583
Riku, I'll be taking advantage
of the wound you left behind.

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:11.958
Damn you!

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:29.250
Setsuna!

00:13:31.667 --> 00:13:33.458
Setsuna!

00:13:36.958 --> 00:13:41.125
<i>When I was young, </i>
<i>I had a younger twin sister...</i>

00:13:41.792 --> 00:13:44.292
<i>...and we lived in the forest </i>
<i>for the longest time.</i>

00:13:45.708 --> 00:13:48.125
Setsuna. No, you can't...

00:13:48.792 --> 00:13:49.917
Setsuna!

00:13:50.583 --> 00:13:53.625
Towa, I'm sorry.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.250
No, don't worry about saying anything.

00:13:56.417 --> 00:13:58.458
I'm going to patch you up right now.

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:04.125
<i>We were always together,</i>
<i>and we got along so well.</i>

00:14:04.417 --> 00:14:09.583
What are those tears, Towa?
It's like I'm going to die or something.

00:14:09.583 --> 00:14:12.125
Of course that's not going to happen!

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:17.375
That's right. Right? I...

00:14:17.958 --> 00:14:21.875
I won't die at a place like this. It's just...

00:14:22.208 --> 00:14:23.708
It's just...?

00:14:23.708 --> 00:14:29.417
I-It's just... I'm getting a little sleepy.

00:14:33.708 --> 00:14:36.167
<i>Then why, at that moment...</i>

00:14:36.958 --> 00:14:39.583
I'm sorry... Sis...

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:45.750
I'm going to sleep... just a little bit...

00:15:05.417 --> 00:15:07.042
Good night.

00:15:11.083 --> 00:15:13.958
<i>Then why, at that moment...</i>

00:15:15.667 --> 00:15:19.042
<i>did I let go of her hand?</i>

00:15:26.917 --> 00:15:30.917
This is truly regrettable.
If we had Sesshomaru's Tenseiga,

00:15:31.417 --> 00:15:34.167
we could have brought her back to life.

00:15:35.333 --> 00:15:40.000
But alas, my older sister Zero,
already broke it in half.

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:51.750
So you've transformed into Beniyasha.

00:15:52.667 --> 00:15:55.750
Will you yet again
become the Destroyer of Lands?

00:15:56.083 --> 00:16:00.000
If that were the case, then maybe
you would've lived a bit longer.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.042
What?

00:16:01.042 --> 00:16:06.583
This is the first time I've ever felt
so calm after applying my rouge.

00:16:07.125 --> 00:16:11.250
I bet this is probably
the true Beniyasha's power.

00:16:18.125 --> 00:16:21.917
Kirinmaru, you're going to die here.

00:16:26.125 --> 00:16:27.167
It can't be...

00:16:29.333 --> 00:16:34.000
That's right, this is the place
where he died, isn't it?

00:16:34.875 --> 00:16:36.542
Wait, Moroha.

00:16:40.625 --> 00:16:41.667
That's...

00:16:44.583 --> 00:16:47.042
Kirinmaru is my prey.

00:16:47.542 --> 00:16:51.708
I'll be the one to avenge Setsuna.

00:16:52.375 --> 00:16:59.292
How dare you kill my Setsuna.
I hope you're ready...

00:16:59.708 --> 00:17:00.917
Kirinmaru!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:05.875
I see. So this is your true power.

00:17:05.875 --> 00:17:07.917
I can't let you have this one, Towa.

00:17:08.333 --> 00:17:12.208
Setsuna was also my precious friend, too.

00:17:12.792 --> 00:17:14.250
It will matter not.

00:17:14.625 --> 00:17:18.583
After all, I am the Beast King of the East,
Kirinmaru of the Dawn.

00:17:19.167 --> 00:17:21.458
Both of you can be my opponents.

00:17:21.833 --> 00:17:23.458
If that's what you want...

00:17:23.458 --> 00:17:24.917
Then we challenge you!

00:17:28.333 --> 00:17:30.833
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:17:40.083 --> 00:17:41.000
What?

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:42.708
Remember this well, Towa.

00:17:43.625 --> 00:17:47.083
Sesshomaru created that attack,
the Azure Dragon Wave.

00:17:47.375 --> 00:17:50.750
However, you turned the dragon
into twin heads.

00:17:51.083 --> 00:17:54.833
From hereon, you shall call this
Twin Azure Dragon Wave.

00:17:55.167 --> 00:17:56.792
And Beniyasha.

00:17:57.333 --> 00:17:59.542
What a magnificent Crimson Dragon Wave.

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:03.000
This dragon will only listen to your will.

00:18:03.333 --> 00:18:06.458
And because of that, I cannot push it away.

00:18:25.083 --> 00:18:26.042
Towa!

00:18:33.667 --> 00:18:35.667
This one stings.

00:18:36.375 --> 00:18:39.167
I never thought you'd
damage me this much.

00:18:39.917 --> 00:18:41.375
He withstood it.

00:18:41.958 --> 00:18:44.167
Wasn't expecting anything less!

00:18:44.667 --> 00:18:47.042
Despite being a half-demon,

00:18:47.042 --> 00:18:51.583
you are doing well to not lose control
with all that demon energy.

00:18:53.625 --> 00:18:55.458
I shall praise you for that.

00:18:57.792 --> 00:19:00.958
Pisses me off how you're
always looking down at us!

00:19:01.625 --> 00:19:03.125
Enough of your lectures.

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:06.667
Whether or not your life
will measure up to Setsuna's...

00:19:08.875 --> 00:19:11.333
I'll find that out right now.

00:19:32.833 --> 00:19:34.750
Splendid. Most splendid.

00:19:35.625 --> 00:19:38.500
This is the sort of battle
I've always wanted!

00:20:30.208 --> 00:20:32.417
Kirinmaru, I'll be taking...

00:20:33.042 --> 00:20:34.417
...your demon energy!

00:20:34.583 --> 00:20:36.833
Go ahead and try!

00:20:49.792 --> 00:20:51.500
Your damn demon energy...

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:53.917
I'll take it all...

00:21:07.125 --> 00:21:09.083
Towa!

00:21:32.292 --> 00:21:34.458
I haven't fought like this

00:21:34.458 --> 00:21:37.208
since my battle
with the Great Dog-Demon.

00:21:37.583 --> 00:21:40.750
It's most unfortunate
that I must end it in such a way.

00:21:41.875 --> 00:21:43.000
Half-Demon Princess.

00:21:43.833 --> 00:21:46.750
I await the next time we can meet.

00:21:50.042 --> 00:21:51.292
Setsuna.

00:21:52.333 --> 00:21:57.458
I shall carve your name onto my heart.
I will never forget you.

00:22:14.917 --> 00:22:16.042
Kirara.

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:19.750
I'm sorry, Setsuna. It looks like we lost.

00:22:20.542 --> 00:22:21.667
Setsuna.

00:22:22.417 --> 00:22:23.667
Setsuna.

00:22:24.417 --> 00:22:28.542
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.
Setsuna, I'm sorry.

00:22:29.917 --> 00:22:32.667
<i>This world is full of the weak.</i>

00:22:33.875 --> 00:22:37.208
<i>But the truly weak...</i>

00:22:37.625 --> 00:22:42.125
<i>...are the ones who couldn't protect</i>
<i>what they wanted to protect most.</i>

00:22:43.583 --> 00:22:44.667
<i>And that's...</i>

00:22:45.750 --> 00:22:48.250
<i>That's what you would call me.</i>

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:52.667
<i>How could I be so weak?</i>

00:23:00.292 --> 00:23:01.917
Sesshomaru.

00:23:07.208 --> 00:23:08.208
What?

00:23:16.667 --> 00:23:19.083
Will you try using this, Towa?

00:23:39.958 --> 00:23:53.984
SECOND SEASON PRODUCTION CONFIRMED
